        <div class="ecosystem-grid-layout">
          <div class="ecosystem-story">
            <div>
              <span class="eyebrow">Product Ecosystem</span>
              <h3>Product is the coordination layer between business, technology and operations.</h3>
              <p>
                My work spans enterprise products where a feature is only one part of the solution. The product has to connect the user journey with workflows, data, integrations, controls, intelligence and operational readiness.
              </p>

              <div class="story-points">
                <div class="story-point"><i></i>Customer and business problem</div>
                <div class="story-point"><i></i>Product journey and workflow</div>
                <div class="story-point"><i></i>AI / GenAI opportunity</div>
                <div class="story-point"><i></i>Automation and integration behavior</div>
                <div class="story-point"><i></i>Data, operations and measurable outcome</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ecosystem-story-foot">Enterprise product thinking — from problem framing to production readiness</div>
          </div>

          <div class="ecosystem-panel">
            <div class="ecosystem-grid">
