            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-card">
            <span class="eyebrow">Connect & Download</span>
            <a class="contact-link primary" href="/Manoj_Pant_Senior_Product_Manager_AI_10Yrs.pdf" download>↓&nbsp; Download Resume (PDF)</a>
            <a class="contact-link" href="mailto:manoj.pant.pm@outlook.com">manoj.pant.pm@outlook.com</a>
